# Installation and launch commands: README.md.
# Public map review needs no credentials.
# Luna uses a locally authenticated Codex CLI session; credentials are never bundled.
# Optional private desktop data directory. Start empty for an independent profile.
# ANIMA_DATA_DIR=/absolute/path/to/private/anima-data
# Optional executable overrides for the pinned project runtime.
# ANIMA_PYTHON=/absolute/path/to/python3.13
# ANIMA_UV=/absolute/path/to/uv
# ANIMA_CODEX_EXECUTABLE=/absolute/path/to/codex
# The normal app offers Luna and offline demo mode. The explicit Luna launch
# commands select Luna for that process. Run the connection check before use.
